{% comment %}
  Emits the <template> swap payloads for one card swatch link: the sibling's
  server-rendered price block (market/currency-correct because it renders in
  the page's own context), its badge row (sale/RWS/made-to-order/custom
  Badge-* tags follow the previewed colorway), and, when the sibling
  qualifies for the size overlay, its variant-availability block so the
  hover overlay can show the previewed colorway's sizes. Consumed by
  assets/card-sibling-preview.js, which clones them over the card's
  price/badges/overlay content on preview. Rendered inside the <a>
  (template is metadata content — valid anywhere, never displayed). The
  availability gate mirrors card-product's show_size_overlay exclusions.

  Accepts:
  - payload_product: {Object} the product this swatch previews (required)
  - section_id: {String} host section id, for badge id scoping (optional)
  - preview_badge: {String} the card slot's preview label, carried onto the
    sibling's badge row so the grid-context label survives the swap (optional)
  - hide_sold_out_badge: {Boolean} suppress the sold-out badge (optional)

  Usage:
  {% render 'sibling-swatch-payload', payload_product: sibling %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- if payload_product.featured_media -%}
  <template class="card__swatch-payload">
    {%- render 'price', product: payload_product, price_class: '', show_compare_at_price: true -%}
  </template>
  <template class="card__swatch-badges">
    {%- render 'card-product-badges',
      card_product: payload_product,
      preview_badge: preview_badge,
      hide_sold_out_badge: hide_sold_out_badge,
      section_id: section_id,
      card: true
    -%}
  </template>
  {%- unless payload_product.type == 'Yarn Skein'
    or payload_product.type == 'Pattern'
    or payload_product.type == 'Repair'
    or payload_product.has_only_default_variant
  -%}
    <template class="card__swatch-availability">
      {%- render 'variant-availability', product: payload_product -%}
    </template>
  {%- endunless -%}
{%- endif -%}
